Package: orac-branding
Version: 1.1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Rick Masterson <rickm1982@gmail.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: plymouth, plymouth-label
Recommends: shadowfetch-themes, plasma-workspace, papirus-icon-theme, fastfetch
Description: ORAC workstation branding for Shadowfetch
 The ORAC look layered on Shadowfetch's own branding and themes packages:
 a Plymouth boot splash with real boot progress, boot messages and an
 encrypted-drive unlock prompt; a Plasma look-and-feel (org.orac.workstation)
 with its KSplash login splash; and the ORAC Orb, Minimal and Workstation
 wallpaper sets; an ORAC terminal banner for fastfetch (orac-terminal-theme
 apply) and an ORAC Void colour scheme and profile for Konsole.
 .
 Installing registers the boot splash but does not switch to it. Activate it
 with: sudo plymouth-set-default-theme -R orac
